#: src/installation/other.md:1
msgid "Other installation methods"
msgstr "其他安装方法"

#: src/installation/other.md:3
msgid ""
"The primary installation method, as described at <https://rustup.rs>, "
"differs by platform:"
msgstr "主要的安装方法，如 <https://rustup.rs> 中所述，因平台不同而有所差异："

#: src/installation/other.md:6
msgid ""
"On Windows, download and run the `rustup-init.exe` built for the [`x86_64-pc-"
"windows-msvc`](https://static.rust-lang.org/rustup/dist/x86_64-pc-windows-"
"msvc/rustup-init.exe) or [`aarch64-pc-windows-msvc`](https://static.rust-"
"lang.org/rustup/dist/aarch64-pc-windows-msvc/rustup-init.exe) target, "
"depending on your OS architecture. In general, this is the build of `rustup` "
"one should install on Windows. This will require [MSVC prerequisites]"
"(windows-msvc.html). If you would prefer to install GNU toolchains or the "
"i686 toolchains by default this can be modified at install time, either "
"interactively, with the `--default-host` flag, or after installation via "
"`rustup set default-host`."
msgstr ""
"在Windows系统中，根据您的操作系统架构，下载并运行为[`x86_64-pc-windows-msvc`]"
"(https://static.rust-lang.org/rustup/dist/x86_64-pc-windows-msvc/rustup-init."
"exe)或[`aarch64-pc-windows-msvc`](https://static.rust-lang.org/rustup/dist/"
"aarch64-pc-windows-msvc/rustup-init.exe)目标版本构建的 `rustup-init.exe` 程"
"序。通常，这种构建版本是应该在Windows上安装的 `rustup`。这需要使用[MSVC "
"prerequisites](windows-msvc.html)。如果您希望默认安装GNU工具链或i686工具链，"
"可以在安装时通过 `--default-host` 标志进行交互式修改，或者在安装后通过 "
"`rustup set default-host` 进行修改。"

#: src/installation/other.md:14
msgid ""
"On Unix, run `curl --proto '=https' --tlsv1.2 -sSf https://sh.rustup.rs | "
"sh` in your shell. This downloads and runs [`rustup-init.sh`](https://static."
"rust-lang.org/rustup/rustup-init.sh), which in turn downloads and runs the "
"correct version of the `rustup-init` executable for your platform."
msgstr ""
"在Unix系统中，在您的shell中运行 `curl --proto '=https' --tlsv1.2 -sSf "
"https://sh.rustup.rs | sh`。这会下载并运行[`rustup-init.sh`](https://static."
"rust-lang.org/rustup/rustup-init.sh)，而后者又会下载并运行适合您平台的 "
"`rustup-init` 可执行文件的正确版本。"

#: src/installation/other.md:23
msgid ""
"`rustup-init` accepts arguments, which can be passed through the shell "
"script. Some examples:"
msgstr ""
"`rustup-init`支持传递参数，这些参数可以通过 shell 脚本来传递。以下是一些示"
"例："

#: src/installation/other.md:26
msgid ""
"```console\n"
"$ curl --proto '=https' --tlsv1.2 -sSf https://sh.rustup.rs | sh -s -- --"
"help\n"
"$ curl --proto '=https' --tlsv1.2 -sSf https://sh.rustup.rs | sh -s -- --no-"
"modify-path\n"
"$ curl --proto '=https' --tlsv1.2 -sSf https://sh.rustup.rs | sh -s -- --"
"default-toolchain nightly\n"
"$ curl --proto '=https' --tlsv1.2 -sSf https://sh.rustup.rs | sh -s -- --"
"default-toolchain none\n"
"$ curl --proto '=https' --tlsv1.2 -sSf https://sh.rustup.rs | sh -s -- --"
"profile minimal --default-toolchain nightly\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```console\n"
"$ curl --proto '=https' --tlsv1.2 -sSf https://sh.rustup.rs | sh -s -- --"
"help\n"
"$ curl --proto '=https' --tlsv1.2 -sSf https://sh.rustup.rs | sh -s -- --no-"
"modify-path\n"
"$ curl --proto '=https' --tlsv1.2 -sSf https://sh.rustup.rs | sh -s -- --"
"default-toolchain nightly\n"
"$ curl --proto '=https' --tlsv1.2 -sSf https://sh.rustup.rs | sh -s -- --"
"default-toolchain none\n"
"$ curl --proto '=https' --tlsv1.2 -sSf https://sh.rustup.rs | sh -s -- --"
"profile minimal --default-toolchain nightly\n"
"```"

#: src/installation/other.md:35
msgid "Using a package manager"
msgstr "使用包管理器"

#: src/installation/other.md:37
msgid ""
"Please note that the rustup project is not maintaining any package mentioned "
"in this section. If you have encountered any problems installing `rustup` "
"with a package manager, please contact the package maintainer(s) for further "
"information."
msgstr ""
"请注意，rustup项目并不维护本部分中提到的任何包。如果您在通过包管理器安装 "
"`rustup` 时遇到任何问题，请联系该包的维护者以获取更多信息。"

#: src/installation/other.md:41
msgid "General tips"
msgstr "通用提示"

#: src/installation/other.md:43
msgid ""
"Different package managers take slightly different approaches towards "
"managing rustup. After installing rustup with your favorite package manager, "
"there are usually two possibilities:"
msgstr ""
"不同的包管理器在管理 rustup 时采取的方法略有不同。使用你喜欢的包管理器安装 "
"rustup 之后，通常有两种可能性："

#: src/installation/other.md:46
msgid ""
"If your package manager has made the `rustup` command available together "
"with proxies for Rust tools such as `rustc` and `cargo`, picking a default "
"toolchain (e.g. `stable`) would usually be enough:"
msgstr ""
"如果你的包管理器已经提供了 `rustup` 命令，同时还提供了对 Rust 工具的代理选"
"项，比如 `rustc` 和 `cargo`，那么通常只需要选择一个默认的工具链（例如 "
"`stable`）即可。"

#: src/installation/other.md:54
msgid ""
"As of 2024/12/23, this is the case for [APT](https://packages.debian.org/"
"search?searchon=names&keywords=rustup), [homebrew](https://formulae.brew.sh/"
"formula/rustup) and [pacman](https://wiki.archlinux.org/title/"
"Rust#Arch_Linux_package)."
msgstr ""
"截至 2024 年 12 月 23 日，以下软件的情况也是如此：[APT](https://packages."
"debian.org/search?searchon=names&keywords=rustup)、[homebrew](https://"
"formula.brew.sh/formula/rustup)以及[pacman](https://wiki.archlinux.org/title/"
"Rust#Arch_Linux_package)。"

#: src/installation/other.md:59
msgid ""
"If your package manager has only made the `rustup-init` command available, "
"simply run:"
msgstr "如果你的包管理器只提供了`rustup-init`命令，那么只需运行该命令即可。"

#: src/installation/other.md:65
msgid ""
"This will allow you to perform the initial setup of `rustup`, populate all "
"the proxies managed by rustup, and install a default toolchain."
msgstr ""
"这将使你能够完成`rustup`的初始设置，配置由`rustup`管理的所有代理服务器，并安"
"装默认的工具链。"

#: src/installation/other.md:68
msgid ""
"As of 2024/12/23, this is the case for [DNF](https://developer.fedoraproject."
"org/tech/languages/rust/further-reading.html)."
msgstr ""
"截至 2024 年 12 月 23 日，[DNF](https://developer.fedoraproject.org/tech/"
"languages/rust/further-reading.html)就是这种情况。"

#: src/installation/other.md:71
msgid ""
"When the installation is completed, please make sure that the rustup proxies "
"(usually under `$HOME/.cargo/bin`) are [correctly exposed](./already-"
"installed-rust.html#ensure-the-correct-path-configuration) via your `$PATH`, "
"and you should be able to run `rustup`, `rustc`, `cargo`, etc. normally."
msgstr ""
"安装完成后，请确保 rustup 代理程序（通常位于 `$HOME/.cargo/bin` 目录下）能够"
"通过 `$PATH` 环境变量被正确访问。这样一来，你就可以正常运行 `rustup`、"
"`rustc`、`cargo` 等命令了。"

#: src/installation/other.md:77
msgid "APT"
msgstr "APT"

#: src/installation/other.md:79
msgid ""
"Starting from Debian 13 (trixie) and Ubuntu 24.04 (noble), you may use `apt` "
"to install `rustup`:"
msgstr ""
"从 Debian 13（trixie）和 Ubuntu 24.04（noble）版本开始，你可以使用`apt`来安装"
"`rustup`："

#: src/installation/other.md:86
msgid "Homebrew"
msgstr "Homebrew"

#: src/installation/other.md:88
msgid "You can use `brew` to install `rustup`[^not-rust]:"
msgstr "你可以使用 `brew` 来安装 `rustup`[^不是rust]："

#: src/installation/other.md:94
msgid ""
"Please note that Rust tools like `rustc` and `cargo` are not available via "
"`$PATH` by default in this `rustup` distribution (see [homebrew-core#177582]"
"(https://github.com/Homebrew/homebrew-core/pull/177582) for more details). "
"You might want to add `$(brew --prefix rustup)/bin` to `$PATH` to make them "
"easier to access."
msgstr ""
"请注意，在这个`rustup`发行版中，像`rustc`和`cargo`这样的 Rust 工具默认并不通"
"过`$PATH`路径可用（更多细节请参考[homebrew-core#177582](https://github.com/"
"Homebrew/homebrew-core/pull/177582)）。您可能需要将`$(brew --prefix rustup)/"
"bin`添加到`$PATH`中，以便更容易访问这些工具。"

#: src/installation/other.md:99
msgid ""
"This is not to be confused with the `rust` package, which is a `brew`\\-"
"managed `rust` toolchain installation."
msgstr ""
"这一点不要与“rust”软件包混淆，后者是一个通过“brew”工具安装的“rust”语言工具"
"链。"

